# `geo`

Geometry for the plane: shapes, and storing them.

The root module's page lists the modules under it.

## Modules

- [`geo.shapes`](geo.shapes.md): Shapes and their areas.
- [`geo.store`](geo.store.md): Keeping shapes in files.

## Re-exports

- `Figure`: [`geo.shapes.Shape`](geo.shapes.md#Shape)
- `Meters`: `units.Meters`
- `store`: [`geo.store`](geo.store.md)

## Contents

- [`EPSILON`](#EPSILON): How far apart two coordinates may be and still be the same.

<a id="EPSILON"></a>
## `EPSILON`

```sisu
const EPSILON: f64
```

How far apart two coordinates may be and still be the same.
